name: Goal relevance stays separate from finding truth and exact source history
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS | review-origin
nav-mode:
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 Unassessed | goals
keys: b
require-live-snap: 20 EXACT SAVED BRIEF | brief
expect: never finding verdicts
keys: b i
require-live-snap: 20 Source snapshot | observation-receipt
keys: i
resize: 160x48
live-snap: goals-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: goals-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: goals-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: goals-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Esc return | goals-40x12
keys: ?
require-live-snap: 20 GOAL REVIEW CONTROLS | controls-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: controls-page-40x12
keys: Escape
ask: Are goal priorities, source limitations and actions understandable at all six sizes, with no implication that relevance establishes validity?
resize: 120x36
keys: 1
paste-file: @ART/reason.txt
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | quit-with-reason
expect: goal relevance draft
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+S review | stayed-with-reason
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW GOAL ASSESSMENT | confirm-direct
expect: No model calls
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Saved assessment v1 | saved-direct
expect: Relevance: Direct
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Saved assessment v1 | saved-direct-40x12
keys: 2
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+S review | reason-40x12
expect: note.txt:1
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW GOAL ASSESSMENT | review-40x12
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW GOAL ASSESSMENT | pending-second
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART conflict
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Goal relevance changed | conflict
expect: reason is retained
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+S review | conflict-reason
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 GOAL RELEVANCE · workspace | conflict-list
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Relevance: Uncertain | refreshed-conflict
keys: 2
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 Previous reason | reviewed-replacement
expect: 東京 reason
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Saved assessment v3 | replaced
expect: Relevance: Related
keys: h
require-live-snap: 20 second operator | history
expect: GOAL ASSESSMENT HISTORY
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 GOAL RELEVANCE · workspace | history-return
keys: u
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+S review | clear-reason
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW GOAL ASSESSMENT | clear-review
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Saved assessment v4 | cleared
expect: Relevance: Unassessed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART revised
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Showing saved brief repository v1 | frozen-brief
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 repository v2 | latest-brief
expect: Unassessed
ask: Does a conflicting write retain the reason, require review of the replacement, and keep cleared and older-brief assessments in history without changing finding verdicts?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | review-restored
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: goals
require-live-snap: 25 repository v2 | restarted-goals
expect: Unassessed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/goal_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart retain exact brief revisions, all four assessment revisions and the three unchanged policy observations with no model requests or finding decisions?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
